".gallery 保留角色、热点、各阶段动画、大小与外观设置。.cape 是 Mousecape 主题，包含常态光标；导入后可在 Gallery 补充交互动画。" = ".gallery preserves roles, hotspots, animation phases, sizes and appearance settings. .cape is the Mousecape format for normal cursors; you can add interaction animations in Gallery after importing.";
"Windows 光标与素材文件夹" = "Windows cursors and folders";
"CUR 是静态光标，ANI 是动态光标。可直接选择文件，或选择包含它们的文件夹。INF 用于映射角色，请将它与原来的素材目录一起保留。" = "CUR contains a static cursor; ANI contains an animated cursor. Select files directly or choose their folder. INF maps assets to cursor roles; keep it together with its original asset folders.";
"安装包与压缩包" = "Installers and archives";
"支持包含光标资源的 .NET、.NET 单文件与 Inno Setup 安装包，以及包含可用素材的 ZIP。单个包最大 2 GB；仅读取光标，不运行 Windows 程序，壁纸、应用图标与其他内容会跳过。" = "Supported sources include .NET, .NET single-file and Inno Setup installers with embedded cursors, and ZIP archives containing usable assets. Packages can be up to 2 GB. Gallery reads cursor data without running Windows programs; wallpapers, app icons and other content are skipped.";
"并非所有 EXE 都内含可提取的素材。快捷安装入口、加密或其他不支持的封装导入失败时，请改用解压后的 CUR／ANI 文件夹。原文件不会修改。" = "Some EXE files do not contain extractable assets. If a launcher, encrypted package or unsupported format fails to import, use an extracted CUR/ANI folder instead. Original files are left unchanged.";
"Windows 素材可能只包含常态动画。按下、按住与松手需要对应素材，可在导入后补充；已有主题缺少的其他版本也可在角色页添加。" = "Windows assets may include only normal animations. Press, hold and release phases need their own assets, which you can add after importing. Add missing alternatives to an existing theme from its role editor.";
"导入与使用" = "Importing and using themes";
"选择文件或文件夹" = "Choose files or a folder";
