"查看映射说明" = "View mapping guide";
"保存" = "Save";
"未配对角色使用系统光标？" = "Use system cursors for unpaired roles?";
"以下 %lld 个原生角色尚未配对，应用主题时会保留 macOS 原生光标。是否继续？" = "These %lld system roles are unpaired and will keep their macOS cursors when you apply this theme. Continue?";
"使用系统光标并继续" = "Keep system cursors and continue";
"删除未使用的主题素材？" = "Delete unused theme materials?";
"以下 %lld 个主题角色未用于映射。删除会从当前主题的本地存档中移除这些素材及不再引用的图像，以节省空间；仍被其他角色使用的图像会保留。" = "These %lld theme roles are unused. Deleting them removes their materials and any unreferenced images from this theme’s local archive to save space. Images still used by other roles are kept.";
"删除并保存" = "Delete and save";
"保留并保存" = "Keep and save";
"当前常态素材" = "Current normal material";
"选用此版本" = "Use this variant";
"系统图像暂不可用" = "System image unavailable";
"映射说明" = "Mapping guide";
"把喜欢的素材，分配给 macOS 的每一种光标。" = "Choose artwork for each macOS cursor.";
"两侧橱窗" = "The two columns";
"左侧显示 macOS 原生角色，优先读取系统矢量图像；没有对应文件时使用原生接口或替换前的备份。右侧是当前主题保存的素材。绑定后优先移动右侧；连线仍交错时，会适当调整左侧顺序，使同组角色相邻。" = "The left column shows macOS cursor roles using system vectors where available, otherwise native cursor data or original backups. The right column contains materials saved in this theme. Connections move the right column first; when lines still cross, the left column also groups related roles together.";
"选择与绑定" = "Select and bind";
"先点击一侧橱窗，再点击另一侧，两者之间的连线表示绑定。蓝框表示当前选中，再点一次同一橱窗可取消选中。每个原生角色只能选一份素材；同一素材可分配给多个原生角色。" = "Click a card on either side, then one on the other side. A line shows their binding. A blue border marks a selection; click the same card again to deselect it. Each system role has one material, while one material can supply several system roles.";
"版本预览" = "Preview variants";
"素材橱窗右上角的省略号会打开版本面板。先选择并预览一个版本，再点「选用此版本」。常态使用所选版本，待机、按下、按住与松手配置一并复制。" = "The ellipsis at the top right of a material card opens its variants. Select and preview a variant, then click Use this variant. The chosen variant supplies Normal; Idle, Press, Hold and Release settings are copied as well.";
"取消绑定与独立编辑" = "Unbind and edit independently";
"双击连线即可取消绑定。保存后，各原生角色拥有独立的大小、热点与动画；即使使用同一份来源素材，编辑其中一个也不会改变其他角色。" = "Double-click a connection to unbind it. After saving, every system role has its own size, hotspot and animations. Editing one role leaves other roles unchanged, even if they use the same source material.";
"保存与清理" = "Save and clean up";
"点击右上角「保存」。如有未配对的原生角色，先确认是否保留系统光标；如有未使用的主题素材，再选择删除以节省空间，或保留供以后使用。全部配对且没有未用素材时会直接保存。" = "Click Save at the top right. If any system roles are unpaired, first confirm keeping their system cursors. If any theme materials are unused, then choose to delete them to save space or keep them for later. With all roles paired and no unused materials, saving is immediate.";
"删除只清理当前主题在 Gallery 内的存档，不改动导入时选择的 EXE、ZIP、文件夹或其他主题。关闭映射窗口并放弃更改时，原有主题保持不变。" = "Deletion only cleans up this theme’s archive in Gallery. It does not alter the EXE, ZIP or folder selected at import, or any other theme. Closing the mapping window and discarding changes leaves the existing theme unchanged.";
"以后可通过标题旁的 ⓘ 再次查看。" = "Open this guide again with ⓘ beside the title.";
"中文名称由 Gallery 根据用途翻译，不是系统提供的中文名单。编号角色没有已确认的公开名称；反色 I 型槽在本机仅返回红色方块，不能把它视作日常文本光标的标准外观。" = "Gallery translates role labels by their purpose; macOS does not supply this Chinese list. Numbered slots have no confirmed public name. On this Mac, the inverted I-beam slot returns only a red square; it is not a reliable preview of an everyday text cursor.";
"使用 macOS 原生光标" = "Keep the macOS cursor";
"先点击一侧橱窗，再点击另一侧，立即完成绑定并高亮对应连线。连接后清空橱窗选择；点击空白处清空所有选择。每个原生角色只能选一份素材，同一素材可分配给多个角色。" = "Choose a card on either side, then one on the other side to connect immediately and highlight the connection. Connecting clears card selection. Click empty space to clear every selection. Each native role accepts one material; one material can supply several roles.";
"单击连线使其高亮，再次单击取消高亮；快速双击才会解除绑定。绑定或解绑后，视图会平滑跟随左侧角色。保存后，各目标的大小、热点与动画彼此独立。" = "Click a connection to highlight it, and click again to deselect. Double-click to disconnect. After connecting or disconnecting, the view smoothly follows the native card. Saved destinations retain independent size, hotspot and animation settings.";
"右上角可撤回映射操作，或恢复当前保留素材的导入对应关系。恢复操作也可以撤回；已经删除的素材无法找回。" = "Use the top-right controls to undo a mapping change or restore the imported assignments for retained sources. You can undo a restore. Previously deleted materials cannot be recovered.";
"恢复" = "Restore";
"恢复导入时的对应关系" = "Restore Import Mapping";
"恢复导入时的对应关系？" = "Restore the imported mapping?";
"恢复当前保留素材的导入对应关系，可通过撤回恢复本次操作。此前已删除的素材无法找回；不会重置主题整体大小或像素风格。" = "Restore the imported role assignments for materials still retained in this theme. You can undo this action. Previously deleted materials cannot be recovered. Overall theme size and pixel style stay as configured.";
"撤回" = "Undo";
"未用于任何原生角色" = "Not assigned to a native role";
"系统名称与旧槽位" = "System Names and Legacy Slots";
"调整与撤回" = "Appearance and Undo";
"旧系统槽位，公开用途未确认" = "Legacy slot; public purpose unconfirmed";
"尚未映射 · 点击分配" = "Unassigned · Click to map";
"连接素材" = "Connect Materials";
"点一侧橱窗，再点另一侧。" = "Choose a card on one side, then one on the other.";
"一次完成连接并高亮对应连线。橱窗选择会自动清空，无需再点一次。" = "This connects and highlights the line immediately. Card selection clears automatically; no extra click is needed.";
"选择与解除" = "Select and Disconnect";
"单击选线，快速双击解除。" = "Click to select a line. Double-click to disconnect.";
"再次单击连线取消高亮；点击空白处清空连线和橱窗的选择。" = "Click the line again to remove its highlight. Click empty space to deselect every line and card.";
"版本与撤回" = "Versions and Undo";
"点省略号选版本，点右上角撤回。" = "Use the ellipsis for versions and the top-right arrow to undo.";
"版本面板中点「选用此版本」确认。右上角的恢复按钮可恢复导入对应关系，该操作也能撤回。" = "Choose Use This Version in the preview panel. The top-right restore button restores imported assignments; this action can also be undone.";
"保存更改" = "Save Changes";
"点右上角「保存」完成。" = "Choose Save at the top right to finish.";
"有未配对角色时先确认使用系统光标，再单独选择是否删除未用素材。确认列表可在窗口内滚动。" = "For unpaired roles, first confirm keeping system cursors, then choose whether to delete unused materials. Scroll inside each confirmation list.";
"补充说明" = "Additional Details";
"左侧为 macOS 原生角色的固定预览，不随正在使用的主题改变；右侧为主题保留的素材。名称采用系统接口名或真实标识符，并附功能说明；未公开槽位的用途可能未确认。反色 I 型槽的系统原图为红色方块，不代表日常文本光标的外观。" = "The left column shows fixed native macOS previews, unaffected by the active theme; the right contains retained theme materials. Labels use system API names or actual identifiers with functional descriptions. The purpose of undocumented slots may be unconfirmed. The original inverted I-beam image is a red square, not the everyday text cursor.";
"右侧预览忽略主题整体及角色的自定义缩放，保留动画帧与播放节奏。各素材自动适应预览区域，相差不超过 2% 的倍率统一取较小值。实际使用大小仍以主题与角色设置为准。" = "Right-side previews ignore custom theme and role scaling while preserving animation frames and timing. Each material fits its preview area; scales within two percent share the smaller value. Applied cursor size still follows theme and role settings.";
"同一素材可分配给多个原生角色，保存后各目标的大小、热点与动画独立。布局变化时视图会跟随左侧角色；手动滚动可中断跟随。" = "One material can supply several native roles. Saved destinations retain independent size, hotspot and animation settings. The view follows the native card when layout changes; manual scrolling interrupts it.";
"删除只清理当前主题在 Gallery 内的未用素材，不改动原始安装包或其他主题。已经删除的素材不能通过恢复按钮找回；放弃未保存的映射不会更改主题。" = "Deletion removes unused materials only from this theme inside Gallery. Original installers and other themes remain intact. Restore cannot recover deleted materials. Discarding an unsaved mapping leaves the theme unchanged.";

"请先停用主题，再编辑映射。" = "Stop the theme before editing its mapping.";
